Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They called him the.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Iíí? H!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me share the one dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby, baby, oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see or to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought up by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my eye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll\Ntry. No matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go on straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.58,0:01:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.38,0:01:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.78,0:02:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.96,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to meet you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And see the spirited boy for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't in good\Nconscience talk about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,involving Shanks that he\Nhasn't mentioned yet himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, you've done\Nwell to make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Shanks is eagerly awaiting\Nyour arrival in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't wait to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, getting down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.74,0:03:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you wanted\Nyour ship coated, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's high time for me\Nto return to my real work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.93,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.85,0:03:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure exactly how\Nmuch the coating would cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, don't you worry about it, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't possibly take\Nmoney from friends of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.00,0:03:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure why, but he's doing it for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We certainly appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very generous of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is the will of D?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a Poneglyph on Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger's name was inscribed on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In that ancient form of\Nwriting, how does he know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:03:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he use that language?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will guide this passage all the\Nway to the farthest ends of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate Gold D Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you learn what happened to the\Nworld during the Blank Century?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The missing history from 900 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We learned all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The entirety of the missing history.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But miss, you mustn't be so hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep moving forward. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your journey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We and Ohara might have hurried\Ntoo much for our own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's not\Nwhat you wanted to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I told you everything you wanted\Nto know about that history here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,just as you are, you couldn't\Ndo anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've taken the time\Nto really see the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it might change your outlook and\Npossibly lead you to a different answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you still insist on hearing\Nit, I can tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then continue my journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll all make sense to\Nyou one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry for what happened\Nin your homeland of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't change the fact that\NRoger didn't decipher that writing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We were all pirates, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not geniuses or scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No match for Clover or the\Nother great minds of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Captain Roger just heard\Nthe voice of the universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're passing\Nup a pretty big opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old guy, I've got\Na question of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The treasure Roger talked\Nabout, the legendary One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is it really...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:05:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know where\Nthe One Piece is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.24,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to know if it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single one of us\Nput our life on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and set out to sea\Nwithout knowing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather give up being\Na pirate than know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go on a boring adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to sail and\Nfind out for ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It just slipped out of\Nmy mouth, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered. I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die if I learn anything\Nabout the One Piece disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything, old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.34,0:06:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, in that case, let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The new world far surpasses\Nanything you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your foes will be powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.40,0:07:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, do you still think\Nyou can rule this mighty sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What I don't want to rule\Nanything being king of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the pirates is about being\Nmore free than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say I like your
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,style your ship is in\NGrove number one right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll head over\Nthere now and get started
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you plan to do\Nanyway at any moment an?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral could be here looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll only be a nuisance if we stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe we go shopping.\NWhat? Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're being chased by\Nthe world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stick together, that makes us\Nan easy target for those Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll be easier for the\Nold guy to finish his work
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,if we each find somewhere to\Nlay low in town for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:07:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I say we split up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,keep track of the work, and when\Nit's done, we meet back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that guy strategizing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's not Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chaka, we have any cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I believe there's one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is a Vibra card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That simplifies things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I happen to be a\Nbit notorious myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll move your ship from Grove No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,1 and work on it somewhere more secluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.78,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need three days to\Ncomplete the coding process.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it take so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It needs time to seal so\NI can't go any faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's three days of\Nsurvival in the woods for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet at sundown three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what grove I'll be on then,\Nso use the beaver cards to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever it leads you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that will be the place where I'll be\Nfinishing the coding and waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably a good idea\Nfor you to pick up some
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,supplies for your underwater\Nvoyage to Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, all of you, thank\Nyou for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.24,0:08:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I caused you guys so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll show you the way to Fishman\NIsland. Don't worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so do your best to stay\Nclear of the marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi, get plenty of bed rest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See you again in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be there to send you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, nice lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're up against an admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to make sure\Nnone of us gets killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop saying scary stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all go to the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, yeah. Take care of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,yourselves we will you do the same
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should be off too
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:10:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a whirlwind ever\Nsince we got here. But I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't expecting to run\Ninto Roger's vice-captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of stunned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.20,0:10:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a pretty intimidating\Nguy for an old geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.28,0:10:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give him that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he is the most famous man in\NRoger's crew, and deservedly so it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.34,0:10:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what crewmen on the\NOdo Jackson were like, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving a hand to that Roger guy\Nis something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm glad I got to meet him. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have pegged you for someone\Nwho had such reverence for your elders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.31,0:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sometimes I do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.44,0:10:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the amusement park!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.52,0:10:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Admiral Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let those pirates escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there are wanted men\Neverywhere on this archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out for the ones\Nworth over 100 million
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Admiral Kizaru
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's awful strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, hold on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,there's still a chance I think I can get
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the drop on him and\Ntake him down from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I do, I'll be famous. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your damn mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of the strongest guys\Nin the Marines we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take this! No, wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.10,0:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I didn't miss him that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet passed right through his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so terribly odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's obviously got some kind\Nof crazy Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:11:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Guns aren't going to work on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but I was wondering\Nif you could help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here looking for a man\Nnamed Sentomaru, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a subordinate of\Nmine. Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.02,0:12:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, all I did was ask him a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Admiral Kizaru\Nwent a hair overboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.12,0:13:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He does better than to break\Nthe hustle muscle mangroves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I forget my own strength sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Admiral Kizaru, I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Apoo, this is\Ndangerous for us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.26,0:13:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We really need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What fun is there in slinking away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better to run after\Nyou've pissed your enemy off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're questing backup at the harbor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.02,0:13:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, and I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but all the soldiers have\Nturned into kids and old people!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My own back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the one that did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was jewelry bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a bounty of 140 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a capone, gang bang, and you've\Ngot 138 million berry bounty. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sailing out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.32,0:14:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What did your crew run off and leave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.96,0:14:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.94,0:14:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of tough, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys are outmatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, excuse me, but I was wondering\Nif you fellas could help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep him busy for\Nyou, Captain. Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be dying today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But the best place to hide\Nis in the amusement park.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so full of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.56,0:14:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want to screw\Naround and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Get those cannons ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gunplots!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence bombardment! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is flying out of his chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.90,0:15:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't even have to lift a finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at his stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:15:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.32,0:16:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The power works, but I think I'm starting\Nto see why they call him the gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Firing squad, take aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.34,0:16:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch with the smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter, take it easy. It's too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Told ya, you'll need\Nmore troops than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the seven warlords\Nhas joined the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of them is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it was too much to ask\Nto sneak past Navy headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My pride won't let me walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, please, you must escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hawkins, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chance of defeat, 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon, but could you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chance of success, 12%.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a man named Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense, chance of evasion, 76%.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know of no such man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.18,0:17:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ask someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if I can't find him, that leaves\Nme with a bit of spare time, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I have some spare time, I\Nobviously can't let a wanted man escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially one with a 249 million berry
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounty magician Basil Hawken. Speed is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,weight observe This is what it feels\Nlike to be kicked at the speed of light?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we under attack? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:18:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He just suddenly went flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that. He's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, what's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He just burst into flames.\NWho attacked? And from where?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that impressive? You far\Nsurpassed what I imagined. Now ain't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that weird to think Two would be\Ndestroyed already against an admiral
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,such as yourself I might feel nervous
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with ten
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.87,0:19:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,hold
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,on
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is that the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,mad monk Arouge and he's not alone\Neither that's Bartholome I am you, Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,one of the seven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kizaru! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a navy admiral ahead\Nof me, and a warlord behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see the shadow of death upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins of the North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, thanks for the tip,\Nfoe though you may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh good, it looks like someone\Nelse decided to join the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Flag Diaz Drake, why's he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah crap, I hadn't planned\Non running into Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken quite a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's see if Hawkins'\Nprediction is true or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be some hope for me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start this over. Nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.50,0:20:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got blast here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever stays here is gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.36,0:20:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to party, and\Nthat's Captain's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.80,0:20:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.22,0:20:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the seven\Nwarlords of the sea. He is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you guys know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.12,0:21:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, don't let that attack hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shockwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw what is that? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he can do this crap too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you lied, that wasn't a shockwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.20,0:21:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be impressed\Nstraight to your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Comane, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I remember him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the guy that showed up at\NThriller Park I never fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.80,0:21:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the very same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.52,0:21:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Things got pretty dicey\Nwhen he started shooting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,at us with shockwaves and\Nthe paws on his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.60,0:21:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We barely made it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that we are still alive is\Nprobably the reason he came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:22:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we got lucky last\Ntime, but he's here to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.76,0:22:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, that's one way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But I call this payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.90,0:22:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.52,0:22:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, second gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.72,0:22:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We know he's strong, no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.36,0:22:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go all out from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.00,0:22:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off here he seems\Ndifferent from the last time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long? The warship\Nshould have been here by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't uncle keezaryu\Ncontacted me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chaos already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or there won't be any rookies left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.58,0:23:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at this rate.
